"management","s":"James M. Frates","x":"First, we believe 35 is the right size for the sales force.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/04/27/alkermes-alks-q1-2018-earnings-conference-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"ALKS 2018 Q4","e":"alks","d":"2019-02-14","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"James M. Frates","x":"I would say that this investment we're making now -- we feel very comfortable with -- that we're right-size now, going into '19 on the Aristada and Vivitrol sides, and it actually gives us a really nice platform on the health systems side, on the hospital side, and on the key account manager's…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/14/alkermes-plc-alks-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"ALKS 2019 Q1","e":"alks","d":"2019-04-25","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"James M. Frates","x":"We're confident in our outlook for the year and today we are reiterating the 2019 guidance we provided in February.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/26/alkermes-plc-alks-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ALKS 2019 Q1","e":"alks","d":"2019-04-25","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"James M. Frates","x":"I think we are -- as you mentioned we reiterated guidance this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/26/alkermes-plc-alks-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ALKS 2019 Q2","e":"alks","d":"2019-07-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Richard Pops","x":"This is to extent it involves a restructuring of Part D that affects 100 senators and 50 states and a lot of interest groups.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/25/alkermes-plc-alks-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ALKS 2019 Q3","e":"alks","d":"2019-10-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Richard F. Pops","x":"So as you can see from today's restructuring announcement, we're looking ahead and taking actions to position Alkermes for sustainable, long-term growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/23/alkermes-plc-alks-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ALKS 2019 Q3","e":"alks","d":"2019-10-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Richard F. Pops","x":"Our priorities are to maximize the value of our commercial products and our development candidates while streamlining our cost structure in order to position the Company for sustained profitability.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/23/alkermes-plc-alks-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ALKS 2019 Q4","e":"alks","d":"2020-02-13","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"James M. Frates","x":"We implemented a restructuring in the fourth quarter that recalibrated our cost structure and focused our R&D investments in programs with the highest potential value and we acquired Rodin Therapeutics, which further diversified our pipeline.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/13/alkermes-plc-alks-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ALKS 2019 Q4","e":"alks","d":"2020-02-13","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"James M. Frates","x":"In terms of our operating expenses, as we evaluated our cost structure last year, we implemented a restructuring designed to deliver savings of approximately $150 million in 2020 with about one-third related to R&D and two-thirds driven by SG&A, while preserving our ability to invest…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/13/alkermes-plc-alks-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ALKS 2020 Q1","e":"alks","d":"2020-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Richard F. Pops","x":"We are in frequent communication with investigators and like other biopharmaceutical companies we are identifying ways to streamline study visits and enhance data collection to reduce burden on the patients as well as on the investigative sites.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/29/alkermes-plc-alks-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ALKS 2020 Q2","e":"alks","d":"2020-07-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"James M. Frates","x":"SG&A expenses for the second quarter were $132 million, compared to $155.1 million in Q2 2019, reflecting lower expenses due to the restructuring that occurred in late 2019 as well as impacts from COVID-19.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/29/alkermes-plc-alks-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"ALKS 2020 Q3","e":"alks","d":"2020-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"James M. Frates","x":"The decrease was primarily driven by the restructuring that we implemented in late 2019 and the completion of the grumeti Development Program late last year, somewhat offset by increased activity and patient enrollment in the ALEKS 40 to 30 clinical program.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/alkermes-plc-alks-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALKS 2020 Q3","e":"alks","d":"2020-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"James M. Frates","x":"As CNA expenses for the third quarter were $127.7 million, compared to $148.7 million in q3 2019, reflecting lower expenses due to the 2019 restructuring, as well as expense management measures in 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/30/alkermes-plc-alks-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALKS 2020 Q4","e":"alks","d":"2021-02-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Iain Brown","x":"SG&A expenses for 2020 decreased to $538.8 million from $599.4 million in 2019, reflecting the impact in 2020 of the 2019 restructuring of COVID and ongoing expense management measures during the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/11/alkermes-plc-alks-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALKS 2020 Q4","e":"alks","d":"2021-02-11","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Todd Nichols","x":"Late last year, we implemented a reorganization of the commercial infrastructure to streamline the organization and improve efficiencies, with approximately 80 full time positions reallocated to support the anticipated launch.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/11/alkermes-plc-alks-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALKS 2021 Q2","e":"alks","d":"2021-07-28","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Richard Pops","x":"We've reported robust non-GAAP net income for the second quarter, and we're increasing our guidance for the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/28/alkermes-plc-alks-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALKS 2021 Q4","e":"alks","d":"2022-02-16","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Akash Tewari","x":"And then with your new long-term guidance, what programs were specifically discontinued and what was the cost savings associated with that, both in 2022 and beyond?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/02/16/alkermes-alks-q4-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALKS 2022 Q1","e":"alks","d":"2022-04-27","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Umer Raffat","x":"And then I guess, am I hearing it right that it's tracking ahead and you would have raised the guidance, but since it's tracking ahead primarily in part because of the gross to net activity and you kind of want to see the dynamic play out, that's why you're holding off on that because the current…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/04/27/alkermes-alks-q1-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALKS 2022 Q2","e":"alks","d":"2022-07-27","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Richard Pops","x":"DTC, that would be the focus in 2023 and beyond.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/27/alkermes-alks-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALKS 2022 Q2","e":"alks","d":"2022-07-27","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Richard Pops","x":"You really don't want to turn on your DTC campaign if there are access restrictions or if a large number of physicians are unaware of your product.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/27/alkermes-alks-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALKS 2022 Q2","e":"alks","d":"2022-07-27","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Chris Shibutani","x":"Thank you very much and congratulations on the LYBALVI trends and the raised guidance there.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/27/alkermes-alks-q2-2022-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ALKS 2025 Q4","e":"alks","d":"2026-02-25","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"C. Todd Nichols","x":"I am pleased that we delivered at the high end of the increased guidance ranges we provided in October for our proprietary products, driven by strong performance across all three brands.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/25/alkermes-alks-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[33,1,7383,0,0,0,6039,999],[35,1,8282,0,0,0,6594,1296],[36,1,10824,0,0,0,6414,3306],[37,1,9625,0,0,0,8300,947],[38,1,9744,0,0,0,8001,1105],[39,1,8810,0,0,0,7223,1148],[40,1,9688,0,0,0,7788,1331],[41,1,10962,0,0,0,8513,1938],[42,1,10860,0,0,0,8891,1470],[43,1,9246,0,0,0,7957,975],[44,1,8669,0,0,0,7365,913],[45,1,9006,0,0,0,7586,1045],[46,1,7745,0,0,0,6249,944],[47,1,8235,0,0,0,6678,1188],[48,1,9292,0,0,0,7979,755],[49,1,8520,0,0,0,6649,1353],[50,1,7763,0,0,0,6097,952],[64,1,9912,0,0,0,9512,0],[65,1,9735,0,0,0,8005,991],[67,1,10004,0,0,0,7754,1459]],"cinema":[[33,1,7383,0,0,0,6039,999],[35,1,8282,0,0,0,6594,1296],[36,1,10824,0,0,0,6414,3306],[37,1,9625,0,0,0,8300,947],[38,1,9744,0,0,0,8001,1105],[39,1,8810,0,0,0,7223,1148],[40,1,9688,0,0,0,7788,1331],[41,1,10962,0,0,0,8513,1938],[42,1,10860,0,0,0,8891,1470],[43,1,9246,0,0,0,7957,975],[44,1,8669,0,0,0,7365,913],[45,1,9006,0,0,0,7586,1045],[46,1,7745,0,0,0,6249,944],[47,1,8235,0,0,0,6678,1188],[48,1,9292,0,0,0,7979,755],[49,1,8520,0,0,0,6649,1353],[50,1,7763,0,0,0,6097,952],[64,1,9912,0,0,0,9512,0],[65,1,9735,0,0,0,8005,991],[67,1,10004,0,0,0,7754,1459]